      "ActivityOtherHealthServices": false,
      "ActivityPersuitPurposesDescription": "2025 was a year defined by artistic excellence, collective achievement and renewed purpose for Guildhouse. Guided by our new Strategic Plan and Manifesto, we stepped forward with conviction as sector leaders supporting the career development and livelihoods of South Australian artists at  every stage of their career.  Our suite of nationally recognised artistic programs continued to advance practice, encourage experimentation and increase visibility for visual artists, craft makers and designers. Whilst our unique exhibition series, in traditional and non-traditional gallery spaces, connected South Australian artists and their work to new  audiences of over 2 million people.  In 2025 Guildhouse provided an ambitious suite of tailored support services and meaningful employment for artists, generating more than $1.2 million in direct income for artists, artisans and creative  workers.",
